/E (The quarter from April to June 2026 was marked by purposeful action and measuring impact created over the last year through our programs. From taking grassroots sports and fitness closer to children in government schools to strengthening access to education and creating pathways for sustainable livelihoods, our programs continued to turn opportunity into action. Across the field, teams worked alongside children, farmers, educators and communities listening, learning and building solutions rooted in local needs. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
