/E (Project Bhoomi is a grassroots environmental and sustainable agriculture initiative implemented by Roots Foundation, with support from Chambal Fertilisers and Chemicals Limited \(CFCL\) and K K Birla Memorial Society \(KKBMS\). The project addresses two deeply interconnected agricultural and environmental challenges: crop-residue burning, a major contributor to air pollution and soil degradation, and resource-intensive rice cultivation, where traditional paddy transplantation methods consume excessive water and labour.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
